# {{ repo_id }}

A QLoRA adapter that fine-tunes [`{{ base_model }}`](https://huggingface.co/{{ base_model }}) on
chess games written as PGN text. It exists to answer one question with a number: **is a general
language model, fine-tuned on the same games, a substitute for a model built for the job?**

It is part of [Rukh]({{ repository_url }}), a course that builds a chess language model end to
end. The model it is compared against, and how: [{{ course_url }}]({{ course_url }}).

