The games are the same ones the project's own decoder trains on, from the same month, held out
against the same validation split. Each is rendered as the movetext a human would paste into a
chess site, with the two ratings as PGN tags:

```
[WhiteElo "2015"] [BlackElo "2028"]
1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 4. Bd3 Nf6 ... 1-0
```

